{"seq":2,"slug":"mitigation-first-triage-decision","title":"缓解优先的分诊与决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/incident-response-lifecycle/mitigation-first-triage-decision","wordCount":2135,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓解优先的分诊与决策\">缓解优先的分诊与决策</h1><p>大促凌晨 00:04，支付回调失败率抬升，订单创建开始堆积；00:19 告警触发，值班工程师打开面板的第一反应往往是&quot;根因是什么&quot;。这个反应本身就是事故延长的主要来源。缓解优先（mitigation-first）把顺序倒过来：先用最小成本让用户不再受影响，再回头找原因。Google SRE Workbook 第 9 章把这称为 mitigation-first response——&quot;先停止事故的影响，再寻找根因&quot;，除非根因已经显而易见（<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/incident-response/\">sre.google/workbook/incident-response</a>）。分诊阶段要在信息严重不足的前提下，选出一个<strong>可逆、影响面可控、能立即执行</strong>的动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分诊的产出是一个动作-不是一个答案\">核心概念：分诊的产出是一个动作，不是一个答案</h2><p>分诊（triage）的常见误解是&quot;弄清楚发生了什么&quot;。工程上的分诊产出是另一回事：它是<strong>一组已决策的动作</strong>——严重度已落定、事故指挥官（IC）已指派、沟通频道已建立、第一条缓解措施已下达。PagerDuty 的开源事故响应手册把严重度判定表述得非常直接：如果严重度不确定，就&quot;按更高一级处理&quot;，并在事后复盘中回看这个判断（<a href=\"https://response.pagerduty.com/before/severity_levels/\">response.pagerduty.com/before/severity_levels</a>）。判错成高声誉损失可控，判错成低声誉损失不可控——这是分诊阶段少数几条不需要犹豫的规则之一。</p>\n<p>这与阶段模型是同一件事的两面：分诊是&quot;确认与分诊&quot;阶段的执行细节，其出口判据是&quot;决定是否宣告事故并开始缓解&quot;，不是&quot;找到原因&quot;（阶段划分见 <a href=\"response-phase-lifecycle-model\">应急响应阶段生命周期模型</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[收到告警] --&gt; B{信号可信?}&#10;    B --&gt;|噪声| Z[记录并关闭]&#10;    B --&gt;|可信| C[定级: 不确定则取高]&#10;    C --&gt; D[指派 IC + 建频道 + 发首条更新]&#10;    D --&gt; E{是否与最近变更相关?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[回滚/关停该变更]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[选择可逆缓解动作]&#10;    F --&gt; H{核心指标回阈值内?}&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[升级动作: 切流/降级/限流]&#10;    I --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[冻结变更 + 保留证据, 转入定位]\">graph TD\n    A[收到告警] --&gt; B{信号可信?}\n    B --&gt;|噪声| Z[记录并关闭]\n    B --&gt;|可信| C[定级: 不确定则取高]\n    C --&gt; D[指派 IC + 建频道 + 发首条更新]\n    D --&gt; E{是否与最近变更相关?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[回滚/关停该变更]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[选择可逆缓解动作]\n    F --&gt; H{核心指标回阈值内?}\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|否| I[升级动作: 切流/降级/限流]\n    I --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|是| J[冻结变更 + 保留证据, 转入定位]</pre><p>分诊的决策必须留下<strong>可反驳的痕迹</strong>：写下&quot;我认为是变更 X 导致，因此执行回滚 Y&quot;，而不是&quot;我们看了一圈&quot;。有了这条痕迹，五分钟后指标若没回落，团队能立刻知道是假设错了，而不是重新开始茫然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓解动作谱系-按可逆性与副作用排序\">缓解动作谱系：按可逆性与副作用排序</h2><p>缓解不是一个动作，而是一个<strong>按可逆性递减、按破坏性递增</strong>的谱系。选择的原则是：从可逆性最好、副作用最小的一档开始，只在它无效时升级。这个排序是分诊阶段的核心决策依据。Google SRE Workbook 明确警告&quot;通用缓解手段是钝器，可能对服务造成其他破坏&quot;——切流可能把错误挤到另一个区域，重启主机可能伤害未受影响的客户（<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/incident-response/\">sre.google/workbook/incident-response</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>主要副作用</th>\n<th>适用时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>关闭功能开关 / 回滚最近一次发布</td>\n<td>高（可再开、可重发）</td>\n<td>丢失新功能带来的转化优化</td>\n<td>故障与最近变更强相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>暂停灰度 / 冻结后续发布</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无（只是停止推进）</td>\n<td>根因未明但可疑变更正在扩散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>切流至备用通道 / 备用区域</td>\n<td>中（回切需预热）</td>\n<td>成功率、费率、延迟变化</td>\n<td>单一通道或区域故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>降级非核心链路</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>转化、风控精度下降</td>\n<td>核心链路保命</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>限流 / 拒绝部分请求</td>\n<td>低（影响真实用户）</td>\n<td>直接拒绝成交、可能触发平台处罚</td>\n<td>保护系统不雪崩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>重启实例 / 迁移工作负载</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中断在途请求、数据一致性风险</td>\n<td>最后手段，需先保护未受影响工作负载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景里第 1 档还有个特殊优势：<strong>它几乎不产生账务痕迹</strong>。回滚一次结算页配置发布，不会在订单、支付、清关链路上留下半成品状态；而第 4、5 档一旦绕过账务链路，恢复阶段就必须处理一批无法核销的订单。Google SRE 的原则是&quot;停止出血、恢复服务、并为根因分析保留证据&quot;——保留证据意味着缓解动作不应销毁日志与状态快照（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/managing-incidents/\">sre.google/sre-book/managing-incidents</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信息不足下的决策-期望损失与后悔值\">信息不足下的决策：期望损失与后悔值</h2><p>分诊时不可能等到证据齐全。可操作的做法是给每个候选缓解动作估一个<strong>期望损失</strong>，选最小的那个。设动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的破坏性成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>break</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{break}}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">break</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（把好事也弄坏的代价），它命中真实根因的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，不动作下每分钟损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，预计定位还需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>break</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{cost}(a)] = C_{\\text{break}}(a)\\cdot(1-p(a)) + L \\cdot t \\cdot (1-p(a))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">break</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p(a))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 这一项：<strong>破坏性成本只在动作没命中时全额发生</strong>。这正是&quot;先回滚再想&quot;在数学上占优的原因——回滚的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>break</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{break}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">break</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很小（最坏情况是白回滚一次），所以哪怕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 只有三四成，它的期望损失也远低于&quot;再观察十分钟&quot;里那个不断累加的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。用最大化后悔值最小的准则做近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></munder><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>场景</mtext></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>场景</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>oracle</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>场景</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{*} = \\arg\\min_a \\max_{\\text{场景}} \\big[ \\text{cost}(a, \\text{场景}) - \\text{cost}(a_{\\text{oracle}}, \\text{场景}) \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">场景</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">场景</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">oracle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">场景</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个判据指向同一结论：<strong>优先选&quot;错了也不亏&quot;的动作</strong>。PagerDuty 的分级指南把这条写成了可执行规则：对 SEV-3，&quot;若与最近部署相关，则回滚&quot;（<a href=\"https://response.pagerduty.com/before/severity_levels/\">response.pagerduty.com</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商的缓解约束-幂等-对账与监管时钟\">跨境电商的缓解约束：幂等、对账与监管时钟</h2><p>跨境电商的缓解动作多了三条在其他服务里不存在的约束，分诊时必须同时满足。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，支付动作必须幂等。</strong> 任何重试或切流都可能造成同一笔支付被处理两次。Stripe 的幂等键机制保存首个请求的状态码与响应体，重复键返回同一结果，键最长 255 字符、至少保留 24 小时后自动清理（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests\">docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests</a>）。缓解动作若是&quot;重发未确认的支付回调&quot;，必须确保携带原幂等键，否则会凭空造出重复扣款。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，Webhook 回调不可依赖顺序。</strong> Stripe 明确不保证事件按生成顺序送达，且生产环境用指数退避重试最长 3 天；去重应基于事件 ID 而非时间戳，并&quot;在处理复杂逻辑前先快速返回 2xx&quot;（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/webhooks\">docs.stripe.com/webhooks</a>）。这意味着分诊阶段不能靠&quot;等回调补上&quot;来止血，真正的止血点在自己的订单状态机——补单、对账必须独立于回调到达时序。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，监管时钟与工程时钟并行计时。</strong> 一次导致支付中断的重大事故，其报告义务不受&quot;我们还在定位&quot;影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法规</th>\n<th>首报</th>\n<th>中报</th>\n<th>终报</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NIS2（指令 Article 23）</td>\n<td>24 小时内早期预警</td>\n<td>72 小时内事件通报</td>\n<td>通报后 1 个月内终报</td>\n<td>获知重大事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DORA（Article 19）</td>\n<td>分类后 4 小时内初次通报</td>\n<td>初次通报后 72 小时内中期报告</td>\n<td>中期报告后 1 个月内终报</td>\n<td>分类为重大事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NIS2 的三档时限与信任服务提供商的更紧 24 小时通报义务见 <a href=\"https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/nis2-directive\">数字战略 NIS2 页面</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.nis-2-directive.com/NIS_2_Directive_Article_23.html\">NIS 2 指令 Article 23 全文</a>；DORA 的 4 小时/72 小时/1 个月三档及&quot;分类应在获知后无不当延迟、实务上通常 24 小时内完成&quot;见 <a href=\"https://www.regulation-dora.eu/dora-incident-reporting\">DORA 事件报告规则</a>。对做欧盟市场的跨境电商而言，DORA 经由支付机构、收单行向下传导，NIS2 经由关键基础设施供应商传导——<strong>分诊阶段就要判断这次事故是否触发报告义务</strong>，否则工程止血成功、合规失守，代价可能更大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>缓解优先不是&quot;不找根因&quot;，而是<strong>把根因分析与停止影响解耦，让后者先跑起来</strong>。分诊阶段的决策可以压缩成四条可执行规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>输出动作，不输出答案</strong>：严重度、IC、频道、第一条缓解措施，缺一不可。</li>\n<li><strong>不确定就取高</strong>：严重度判高可复盘的代价，远低于判低。</li>\n<li><strong>按可逆性递进</strong>：功能开关/回滚 → 冻结 → 切流 → 降级 → 限流 → 重启，只在下一档无效时升级。</li>\n<li><strong>优先&quot;错了也不亏&quot;的动作</strong>：用期望损失里被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p(a))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 放大的破坏性成本做筛选。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>跨境电商额外绑三条约束：支付动作必幂等（幂等键）、止血点不能依赖回调时序（自己做状态机与对账）、监管时钟与工程时钟并行（NIS2 24h/72h/1月，DORA 4h/72h/1月）。定级本身的判定规则见 <a href=\"../incident-command-system/incident-severity-classification-model\">事故严重度分级模型</a>，角色分工与交接见 <a href=\"../incident-command-system/incident-command-roles-responsibilities\">事故指挥官角色与职责</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[分诊决策] --&gt; B[定级: 不确定取高]&#10;    A --&gt; C[选缓解动作]&#10;    A --&gt; D[判断报告义务]&#10;    C --&gt; E[按可逆性选最低有效档]&#10;    E --&gt; F[执行 + 记录假设]&#10;    F --&gt; G{指标回落?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[升级一档 + 修订假设]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[冻结变更 + 保留证据]&#10;    D --&gt; J[启动 DORA/NIS2 时钟]\">graph TD\n    A[分诊决策] --&gt; B[定级: 不确定取高]\n    A --&gt; C[选缓解动作]\n    A --&gt; D[判断报告义务]\n    C --&gt; E[按可逆性选最低有效档]\n    E --&gt; F[执行 + 记录假设]\n    F --&gt; G{指标回落?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[升级一档 + 修订假设]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[冻结变更 + 保留证据]\n    D --&gt; J[启动 DORA/NIS2 时钟]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓解优先的分诊与决策","id":"缓解优先的分诊与决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分诊的产出是一个动作，不是一个答案","id":"核心概念-分诊的产出是一个动作-不是一个答案"},{"level":2,"text":"缓解动作谱系：按可逆性与副作用排序","id":"缓解动作谱系-按可逆性与副作用排序"},{"level":2,"text":"信息不足下的决策：期望损失与后悔值","id":"信息不足下的决策-期望损失与后悔值"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商的缓解约束：幂等、对账与监管时钟","id":"跨境电商的缓解约束-幂等-对账与监管时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"应急响应阶段生命周期模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/incident-response-lifecycle/response-phase-lifecycle-model"},"next":{"title":"战时沟通与状态同步机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/incident-response-lifecycle/wartime-communication-status-sync"}}